# oracle: fix box/relax aniso in a triclinic cell with xy != 0: native scales xy with ly by default (scalexy on when y is periodic and xy != 0; xy = ly h0_xy / h0_ly in remap), and keeps it with scalexy no
units           lj
atom_style      atomic
lattice         fcc 0.9
region          box prism 0 3 0 3 0 3 0.8 0 0 units lattice
create_box      1 box
create_atoms    1 box
mass            1 1.0
displace_atoms  all random 0.05 0.05 0.05 4123 units box
pair_style      lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff      1 1 1.0 1.0
fix             r all box/relax aniso 0.0 vmax 0.001
thermo_style    custom step pe press pxx pyy pzz pxy lx ly lz xy
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          5
min_modify      line quadratic
minimize        0 0 25 1000
unfix           r
fix             r all box/relax aniso 0.0 vmax 0.001 scalexy no
minimize        0 0 25 1000
